      "id": "unique-event-035:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#35- The sketchbook\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1310,1330]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The sketchbook contains\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1330,1354]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disturbing drawings. Save vs. L4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1354,1387]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Fear or lose 1 Sanity. The drawings\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1387,1423]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "portray a clown named Walrus,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1423,1453]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "blood dripping from his clawed\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1453,1484]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hands. Another sketch depicts a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1484,1516]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "man with a pig’s head and a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1516,1544]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "carnage cleaver in his hands. “This\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1544,1580]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is Pighead who likes to feed\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1580,1609]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children to his pigs. He was\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1609,1638]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "touched by the demon of hunger,”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1638,1671]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "says a note scribbled in brown\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1671,1702]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "crayon.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1702,1710]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": " Another sketch is the picture of a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1710,1746]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fat clown with green hair and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1746,1776]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "grotesque facial features. A note\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1776,1810]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "says “Walrus the Clown, likes\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1810,1840]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "trains and to eat children. He is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1840,1874]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "not a real clown, he wears a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1874,1903]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rubber mask.”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1903,1917]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "On another page, kids with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1917,1946]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "magic book are pictured as they\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1946,1978]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-035:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "cast a spell on Pighead.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[92,1978,2002]]"
    }
  ],
